        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Costura. Sewaddle mastiga folhas para produzir suas roupas, imitando a vestimenta que Leavanny fez para ele. As protuberâncias em sua cabeça são órgãos sensoriais. Quando dois deles se encontram, cumprimentam-se esfregando essas estruturas.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Inseto &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Sewaddle pode evoluir para Swadloon no nível 7 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>String Shot, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Bug Bite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Struggle Bug</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Endure</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Sticky Web</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Bug Buzz</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Flail</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Baton Pass, Bug Bite, Bug Buzz, Calm Mind, Charm, Confide, Double Team, Dream Eater, Electroweb, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Hidden Power, Iron Defense, Light Screen, Lunge, Magic Coat, Magical Leaf, Nature Power, Payback, Pounce, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Signal Beam, Skitter Smack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Struggle Bug, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Agility, Air Slash, Baton Pass, Camouflage, Grassy Terrain, Me First, Mind Reader, Razor Wind, Screech, Silver Wind, Snore, Switcheroo, Synthesis, Worry Seed</p>",
